[{"id":389,"date":"2022-07-14T20:06:38","date_gmt":"2022-07-14T20:06:38","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/?page_id=389"},"modified":"2022-07-14T20:06:38","modified_gmt":"2022-07-14T20:06:38","slug":"other-sites-to-visit","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/other-sites-to-visit\/","title":{"rendered":"Other sites to&nbsp;visit"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here are some links to sites I recommend for more opportunities to learn music from around the world.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Village Harmony <\/strong>has publications with many sources of world music.  They also sponsor &#8220;camps&#8221; for both youth and adults to travel and learn in countries around the world.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.villageharmony.org\/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:\/\/www.villageharmony.org\/<\/a>  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Libana is a women&#8217;s singing group that performs world music among it&#8217;s many other genres.  The have published song books and many music links.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/libana.com\/home\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:\/\/libana.com\/home<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>The Laduvane Songbook.<\/strong>  Jane Peppler created this publication I have treasured throughout the years as a very nice collection of Balkan songs with simple harmonies.  The link is to Amazon.  One of many places this book can be purchased. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-amazon wp-block-embed-amazon\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<div class=\"embed-amazon\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"The New Laduvane Songbook\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"500\" height=\"550\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen allow=\"clipboard-write\" style=\"max-width:100%\" src=\"https:\/\/read.amazon.com\/kp\/card?asin=0981811523\"><\/iframe><\/div>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Here are some links to sites I recommend for more opportunities to learn music from around the world. Village Harmony has publications with many sources of world music. They also sponsor &#8220;camps&#8221; for both youth and adults to travel and learn in countries around the world. <a href=\"https:\/\/www.villageharmony.org\/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:\/\/www.villageharmony.org\/<\/a> Libana is a women&#8217;s singing group that performs [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3074327,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"advanced_seo_description":"","jetpack_seo_html_title":"","jetpack_seo_noindex":false,"jetpack_seo_schema_type":"","_coblocks_attr":"","_coblocks_dimensions":"","_coblocks_responsive_height":"","_coblocks_accordion_ie_support":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false,"reader_suggested_tags":"","_wpcom_ai_launchpad_about_page":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_gallery_page":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_contact_page":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_events_page":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_video_page":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_portfolio_piece":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-389","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/PcCLl-6h","jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_likes_enabled":true,"jetpack-related-posts":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/public-api.wordpress.com\/wp\/v2\/sites\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/pages\/389","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/public-api.wordpress.com\/wp\/v2\/sites\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/public-api.wordpress.com\/wp\/v2\/sites\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/public-api.wordpress.com\/wp\/v2\/sites\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/users\/3074327"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/public-api.wordpress.com\/wp\/v2\/sites\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/comments?post=389"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/public-api.wordpress.com\/wp\/v2\/sites\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/pages\/389\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":390,"href":"https:\/\/public-api.wordpress.com\/wp\/v2\/sites\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/pages\/389\/revisions\/390"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/public-api.wordpress.com\/wp\/v2\/sites\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/media?parent=389"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":26,"date":"2011-01-03T20:30:53","date_gmt":"2011-01-03T20:30:53","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/?page_id=26"},"modified":"2022-07-14T20:09:23","modified_gmt":"2022-07-14T20:09:23","slug":"world-music-chorus-links","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/world-music-chorus-links\/","title":{"rendered":"History of this&nbsp;collection"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Where do the songs come from?&nbsp; The songs come from many years of collecting international folk music.&nbsp; More recently some have come through workshops with performers who specialize in this genre and\/or native singers who are willing to share their culture.<\/p>\n<p>To enable those who are interested to hear the kind of songs I have collected and taught over the years, please go to the sidebar on the left and look at the links.&nbsp; I have a set of links for songs from different countries.&nbsp; All of these posts contain embedded links to YouTube versions so you can listen.&nbsp; These posts also contain Word files with lyrics.&nbsp; Some, not all, offer translations of the words.&nbsp; I try to put a lot of space in between the lines to the lyrics to give a place for personal notes about how to pronounce the words.&nbsp; Maybe sometime for the future I will be able to have sound files with more on pronunciations since that seems to be a big hurdle in learning this type of repertoire.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Where do the songs come from?&nbsp; The songs come from many years of collecting international folk music.&nbsp; More recently some have come through workshops with performers who specialize in this genre and\/or native singers who are willing to share their culture. To enable those who are interested to hear the kind of songs I have [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3074327,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":1,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","meta":{"advanced_seo_description":"","jetpack_seo_html_title":"","jetpack_seo_noindex":false,"jetpack_seo_schema_type":"","_coblocks_attr":"","_coblocks_dimensions":"","_coblocks_responsive_height":"","_coblocks_accordion_ie_support":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false,"reader_suggested_tags":"","_wpcom_ai_launchpad_about_page":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_gallery_page":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_contact_page":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_events_page":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_video_page":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_portfolio_piece":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-26","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/PcCLl-q","jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_likes_enabled":true,"jetpack-related-posts":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/public-api.wordpress.com\/wp\/v2\/sites\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/pages\/26","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/public-api.wordpress.com\/wp\/v2\/sites\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/public-api.wordpress.com\/wp\/v2\/sites\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/public-api.wordpress.com\/wp\/v2\/sites\/chrisgaca.wordpress.com\/users\/3074327"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/public-api.wordpress.com\/w